{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794561788052,"sessionID":"ses_e2bccb12cffeMW9EBW6csHr3DM","part":{"partID":"prt_1d4376f5f001yI9J2llD9TeO8Y","sessionID":"ses_e2bccb12cffeMW9EBW6csHr3DM","messageID":"msg_1d4375c9f001GEwul9W86UJgML","type":"tool","id":"call_c9068c456b17405a972e1e37","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"node --test .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/agents-md-embed.test.cjs 2>&1 | tail -25","workdir":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research","timeout":300000},"output":"✔ a symlinked router the run would leave alone is not refused (161.547625ms)\n✔ .codex/AGENTS.md is folded into the block and then removed (374.930375ms)\n✔ an ignored output path holds the backup and a non-ignored one falls back (213.110833ms)\n✔ the backup survives the run and records what it holds (407.125542ms)\n✔ claude-only creates the root document and removes the copy (705.089834ms)\n✔ --keep-claude-md keeps the copy it folded (668.456334ms)\n✔ an adopted tree with no CLAUDE.md gains the pointer (650.490291ms)\n✔ a router missing shipped rows gains exactly those rows (734.176083ms)\n✔ a missing router is created only when asked for (1356.445791ms)\n✔ .cursor/rules/repo-local.md exists exactly when the block carries content (1934.950958ms)\n✔ a sentence quoting both markers is repository content, not the block (1081.907417ms)\n✔ the preservation proof requires the raw lines of the old document (20.951833ms)\n✔ a marker literal after text is content, and a lone marker line is refused (826.2865ms)\n✔ a document carrying two blocks is refused by name, not as dropped lines (124.91875ms)\n✔ a carried line keeps its leading whitespace (1148.766875ms)\n✔ apply --dry-run prints the plan and writes nothing (297.057ms)\n✔ the plan names the backup apply uses, and a taken directory is re-planned (792.077875ms)\nℹ tests 42\nℹ suites 0\nℹ pass 42\nℹ fail 0\nℹ cancelled 0\nℹ skipped 0\nℹ todo 0\nℹ duration_ms 22118.328333\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"✔ a symlinked router the run would leave alone is not refused (161.547625ms)\n✔ .codex/AGENTS.md is folded into the block and then removed (374.930375ms)\n✔ an ignored output path holds the backup and a non-ignored one falls back (213.110833ms)\n✔ the backup survives the run and records what it holds (407.125542ms)\n✔ claude-only creates the root document and removes the copy (705.089834ms)\n✔ --keep-claude-md keeps the copy it folded (668.456334ms)\n✔ an adopted tree with no CLAUDE.md gains the pointer (650.490291ms)\n✔ a router missing shipped rows gains exactly those rows (734.176083ms)\n✔ a missing router is created only when asked for (1356.445791ms)\n✔ .cursor/rules/repo-local.md exists exactly when the block carries content (1934.950958ms)\n✔ a sentence quoting both markers is repository content, not the block (1081.907417ms)\n✔ the preservation proof requires the raw lines of the old document (20.951833ms)\n✔ a marker literal after text is content, and a lone marker line is refused (826.2865ms)\n✔ a document carrying two blocks is refused by name, not as dropped lines (124.91875ms)\n✔ a carried line keeps its leading whitespace (1148.766875ms)\n✔ apply --dry-run prints the plan and writes nothing (297.057ms)\n✔ the plan names the backup apply uses, and a taken directory is re-planned (792.077875ms)\nℹ tests 42\nℹ suites 0\nℹ pass 42\nℹ fail 0\nℹ cancelled 0\nℹ skipped 0\nℹ todo 0\nℹ duration_ms 22118.328333\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"node --test .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/agents-md-embed.test.cjs 2>&1 | tail -25\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research\",\"timeout\":300000}"},"time":{"start":1794561765215,"end":1794561788052}}}}
