{"type":"text","timestamp":1794561945440,"sessionID":"ses_e2bccb12cffeMW9EBW6csHr3DM","part":{"id":"prt_1d43a16ca002Rt2d1FjaguSqSu","sessionID":"ses_e2bccb12cffeMW9EBW6csHr3DM","messageID":"msg_1d439e238001NGRpUPKd2oBkHK","type":"text","text":"Task complete. T065 implemented and verified.\n\n## Files written\n\n**`.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/agents-md-embed.test.cjs`**\nAdded one case after `a write that throws mid-apply restores the backup and exits 3`, on the `claude-only` fixture with `--create-router`. The write hook, on its second call, writes `not json` to `path.join(backup, 'manifest.json')` and then throws the same `EACCES`. It takes `backup` with `field(planned, 'backup')` and passes the plan output to `trackBackup(t, planned)`. It asserts exit 3, `ERROR: writing`, `ERROR: the restore failed: `, `backup:`, `undo:`, `STATUS=FAIL`, and no `restored:`.\n\n**`.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/agents-md-embed.cjs`**\nWrapped the `restoreFromBackup` call in `commandApply`'s write-fault `catch` in its own `try`/`catch`. A throw now prints `${TAG} ERROR: the restore failed: <message>` with `output.warn`, and the existing `backup:`, `undo:`, `STATUS=FAIL` lines and `return 3` run on both paths, with a comment saying a second fault must not swallow the operator's only way back.\n\n## Verify output\n\nBefore the fix (new case present, no fix):\n\n```\nℹ tests 43\nℹ pass 42\nℹ fail 1\n\ntest at .../agents-md-embed.test.cjs:744:1\n✖ a restore that throws is reported with the backup and undo lines and exits 3\n  SyntaxError [Error]: Unexpected token 'o', \"not json\" is not valid JSON\n      at JSON.parse (<anonymous>)\n      at restoreFromBackup (.../agents-md-embed.cjs:1314:23)\n      at commandApply (.../agents-md-embed.cjs:1429:5)\n```\n\nAfter the fix, `node --test .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/agents-md-embed.test.cjs`:\n\n```\nℹ tests 43\nℹ suites 0\nℹ pass 43\nℹ fail 0\nℹ cancelled 0\nℹ skipped 0\nℹ todo 0\n```\n\nTargeted receipt for the new case:\n\n```\n✔ a restore that throws is reported with the backup and undo lines and exits 3 (143.4385ms)\nℹ tests 1\nℹ pass 1\nℹ fail 0\n```\n\nProbe, `node .../scratch/planning/probe-embed-write-fault.cjs`:\n\n```\nbefore: CLAUDE.md\nmain returned 3\napply printed backup line: true, undo line: true, restored line: true\nafter: CLAUDE.md\nPROBE EXIT:0\n```\n\n`node --check` exits 0 on both changed files.\n\n## Not done / notes\n\n- Nothing outstanding for this task. The `T065` checkbox in `tasks.md` was not ticked.\n- The other hunks shown by `git diff` on those two files belong to earlier phase tasks already in the working tree; my edits are only the new test case and the `try`/`catch` in the write-fault branch.","time":{"start":1794561939146,"end":1794561945440}}}
